cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Automatic Map Configuration from Attribute Profiles"
abstract: >-
  A Python library that proposes the first configuration of a web map of a research dataset from the profiles of its
  columns: the column that gives the title of each record, the field of the colours, the filters, the charts, the
  fields shown for a record and clustering. It computes the profiles from plain records and reads column names and
  headers in English and Greek.
